    <briefdescription>
<para>Actual/Actual day count. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The day count can be calculated according to: <verbatim>   - the ISDA convention, also known as &quot;Actual/Actual (Historical)&quot;,
     &quot;Actual/Actual&quot;, &quot;Act/Act&quot;, and according to ISDA also &quot;Actual/365&quot;,
     &quot;Act/365&quot;, and &quot;A/365&quot;;
   - the ISMA and US Treasury convention, also known as
     &quot;Actual/Actual (Bond)&quot;;
   - the AFB convention, also known as &quot;Actual/Actual (Euro)&quot;.
   For more details, refer to
   http://www.isda.org/publications/pdf/Day-Count-Fracation1999.pdf
</verbatim></para><para><xrefsect id="test_1_test000154"><xreftitle>Tests</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>the correctness of the results is checked against known good values. </para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
